      "en": "**external secrets** (n8n Enterprise): credentials read values from a **vault** (HashiCorp Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, Azure Key Vault, Infisical) at run time with `{{ $secrets.vault.crm_key }}`. A secret changes in one place, nobody inside n8n sees it, and there is a record of who read what. Without Enterprise: Docker secrets and organised rotation."
