      "en": "**sso** (SAML or OIDC with Google Workspace or Microsoft Entra) means staff sign in with the company account, and when someone leaves you disable them once and it closes everywhere. Without SSO: mandatory **2fa** on every account (an app, not SMS). And a «break-glass» owner account with a long password in a vault, for emergencies only."
